Package: leaf.magic
Title: Customisable Icon Markers for 'leaflet'
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jack", "Davison", , "davison.jack.jd@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2653-6615"))
Description: Build customisable markers for 'leaflet' maps using modern icon
    libraries (Font Awesome, Bootstrap Icons, Lucide and Ionicons), text, or
    your own SVG icons. Markers are drawn as SVG images in any colour, size or
    shape, and icons can be mapped to data and explained with legends in the
    same way as colours in 'leaflet'.
